<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:75"><p>
	<span style="font-size:16px;">Each day throughout Metro Atlanta, The Salvation Army Financial Emergency Services Centers provide emergency and life-sustaining assistance with food, clothing, rent/mortgage, utilities, school supplies, and furniture to individuals and families facing a financial crisis.</span>
</p>

<p>
	<span style="font-size:12.0pt;">If you need financial emergency assistance, you may apply online at SAhelp.org. If you are currently facing a personal or financial crisis, call 211 for a list of other Metro Area resources.  211 Is a toll-free, 24-hour, referral line hosted by the United Way of Metro Atlanta. </span>
</p>

<hr>
<p style="text-align:center;">
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size:20px;">The Salvation Army Gwinnett Financial Emergency Assistance Center</span></strong></span>
</p>

